OL,3,GNEWSAMotorcyclist dies after crash with
OL,4,Acar
OL,5,
OL,6,FA motorcyclist has died after a
OL,7,Fcollision with a car, police said.
OL,9,FEmergency services were called to
OL,10,FAtherton Road near Hindley Green in
OL,11,FWigan on Tuesday afternoon.
OL,13,FA Greater Manchester Police (GMP)
OL,14,Fspokesperson confirmed that a
OL,15,Fmotorcyclist involved in the crash has
OL,16,Fdied.
OL,18,FThey said the incident is being
OL,19,Finvestigated by the force's serious
OL,20,Fcollision investigation unit.
